    "reason": "Let's think step by step.\n1. Multiply 858 by 4 (the ones place digit of 624) = 3432\n2. Multiply 858 by 20 (the tens place digit of 624) = 17160\n3. Multiply 858 by 600 (the hundreds place digit of 624) = 514800",
