    "reason": "Let's think step by step.\n1. Multiply 294 by 0 (the ones place digit of 410) = 0\n2. Multiply 294 by 10 (the tens place digit of 410) = 2940\n3. Multiply 294 by 400 (the hundreds place digit of 410) = 117600",
