    "reason": "Let's think step by step.\n1. Multiply 317 by 2 (the ones place digit of 222) = 634\n2. Multiply 317 by 20 (the tens place digit of 222) = 6340\n3. Multiply 317 by 200 (the hundreds place digit of 222) = 63400",
