    "reason": "Let's think step by step.\n1. Multiply 578 by 2 (the ones place digit of 622) = 1156\n2. Multiply 578 by 20 (the tens place digit of 622) = 11560\n3. Multiply 578 by 600 (the hundreds place digit of 622) = 346800",
