    "reason": "Let's think step by step.\n1. Multiply 428 by 5 (the ones place digit of 775) = 2140\n2. Multiply 428 by 70 (the tens place digit of 775) = 29960\n3. Multiply 428 by 700 (the hundreds place digit of 775) = 299600",
