    "reason": "Let's think step by step.\n1. Multiply 176 by 2 (the ones place digit of 122) = 352\n2. Multiply 176 by 20 (the tens place digit of 122) = 3520\n3. Multiply 176 by 100 (the hundreds place digit of 122) = 17600",
